      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2022 the syndicate had gross claims outstanding of $724.298m. During 2022 there was a net release in prior year reserves of $7.883m (favourable development), driven by favourable incurred claims development across several classes including Property D&F, Marine Hull, Marine Energy, Non-Marine Liability and Political Risk. Management also noted inflationary pressures which were factored into reserving and made specific IBNR allowances of $4.8m related to the Russia/Ukraine conflict. No gross prior-year movement figure was disclosed separately, so the reported net release has been used as the primary quantified prior-year development.",
      "raw_causal_phrases": [
        "Included within net calendar year claims incurred of $193,957,000 (2021: $196,366,000) is a release of $7,883,000 in claims reserves established for losses incurred at the prior year end (2021: release $7,832,000).",
